{"n":83,"ar":"المطففين","name":"Al-Mutaffifin","mean":"The Defrauding","type":"meccan","v":[{"a":["وَيۡلࣱ","لِّلۡمُطَفِّفِينَ"],"w":["Woe","to those who give less"],"t":["waylun","lil'muṭaffifīna"],"p":[1,2],"en":"Woe to those who give less [than due]"},{"a":["ٱلَّذِينَ","إِذَا","ٱكۡتَالُواْ","عَلَى","ٱلنَّاسِ","يَسۡتَوۡفُونَ"],"w":["Those who","when","they take a measure","from","the people","they take in full"],"t":["alladhīna","idhā","ik'tālū","ʿalā","l-nāsi","yastawfūna"],"p":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"en":"Who, when they take a measure from people, take in full"},{"a":["وَإِذَا","كَالُوهُمۡ","أَو","وَّزَنُوهُمۡ","يُخۡسِرُونَ"],"w":["But when","they give by measure (to) them","or","they weigh (for) them","they give less"],"t":["wa-idhā","kālūhum","aw","wazanūhum","yukh'sirūna"],"p":[1,2,3,4,5],"en":"But if they give by measure or by weight to them, they cause loss"},{"a":["أَلَا","يَظُنُّ","أُوْلَـٰٓئِكَ","أَنَّهُم","مَّبۡعُوثُونَ"],"w":["Do not","think","those","that they","(will be) resurrected"],"t":["alā","yaẓunnu","ulāika","annahum","mabʿūthūna"],"p":[1,2,3,4,5],"en":"Do they not think that they will be resurrected"},{"a":["لِيَوۡمٍ","عَظِيمࣲ"],"w":["For a Day","Great"],"t":["liyawmin","ʿaẓīmin"],"p":[1,2],"en":"For a tremendous Day"},{"a":["يَوۡمَ","يَقُومُ","ٱلنَّاسُ","لِرَبِّ","ٱلۡعَٰلَمِينَ"],"w":["(The) Day","will stand","mankind","before (the) Lord","(of) the worlds"],"t":["yawma","yaqūmu","l-nāsu","lirabbi","l-ʿālamīna"],"p":[1,2,3,4,5],"en":"The Day when mankind will stand before the Lord of the worlds"},{"a":["كَلَّآ","إِنَّ","كِتَٰبَ","ٱلۡفُجَّارِ","لَفِي","سِجِّينࣲ"],"w":["Nay","Indeed","(the) record","(of) the wicked","(is) surely in","Sijjin"],"t":["kallā","inna","kitāba","l-fujāri","lafī","sijjīnin"],"p":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"en":"No! Indeed, the record of the wicked is in sijjeen"},{"a":["وَمَآ","أَدۡرَىٰكَ","مَا","سِجِّينࣱ"],"w":["And what","can make you know","what","(is) Sijjin"],"t":["wamā","adrāka","mā","sijjīnun"],"p":[1,2,3,4],"en":"And what can make you know what is sijjeen"},{"a":["كِتَٰبࣱ","مَّرۡقُومࣱ"],"w":["A book","written"],"t":["kitābun","marqūmun"],"p":[1,2],"en":"It is [their destination recorded in] a register inscribed"},{"a":["وَيۡلࣱ","يَوۡمَئِذࣲ","لِّلۡمُكَذِّبِينَ"],"w":["Woe","that Day","to the deniers"],"t":["waylun","yawma-idhin","lil'mukadhibīna"],"p":[1,2,3],"en":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers"},{"a":["ٱلَّذِينَ","يُكَذِّبُونَ","بِيَوۡمِ","ٱلدِّينِ"],"w":["Those who","deny","(the) Day","(of) the Judgment"],"t":["alladhīna","yukadhibūna","biyawmi","l-dīni"],"p":[1,2,3,4],"en":"Who deny the Day of Recompense"},{"a":["وَمَا","يُكَذِّبُ","بِهِۦٓ","إِلَّا","كُلُّ","مُعۡتَدٍ","أَثِيمٍ"],"w":["And not","can deny","[of] it","except","every","transgressor","sinful"],"t":["wamā","yukadhibu","bihi","illā","kullu","muʿ'tadin","athīmin"],"p":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7],"en":"And none deny it except every sinful transgressor"},{"a":["إِذَا","تُتۡلَىٰ","عَلَيۡهِ","ءَايَٰتُنَا","قَالَ","أَسَٰطِيرُ","ٱلۡأَوَّلِينَ"],"w":["When","are recited","to him","Our Verses","he says","Stories","(of) the former (people)"],"t":["idhā","tut'lā","ʿalayhi","āyātunā","qāla","asāṭīru","l-awalīna"],"p":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7],"en":"When Our verses are recited to him, he says, \"Legends of the former peoples"},{"a":["كَلَّاۖ","بَلۡۜ","رَانَ","عَلَىٰ","قُلُوبِهِم","مَّا","كَانُواْ","يَكۡسِبُونَ"],"w":["Nay","But","(the) stain has covered","[over]","their hearts","(for) what","they used to","earn"],"t":["kallā","bal","rāna","ʿalā","qulūbihim","mā","kānū","yaksibūna"],"p":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8],"en":"No! Rather, the stain has covered their hearts of that which they were earning"},{"a":["كَلَّآ","إِنَّهُمۡ","عَن","رَّبِّهِمۡ","يَوۡمَئِذࣲ","لَّمَحۡجُوبُونَ"],"w":["Nay","Indeed, they","from","their Lord","that Day","surely will be partitioned"],"t":["kallā","innahum","ʿan","rabbihim","yawma-idhin","lamaḥjūbūna"],"p":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"en":"No! Indeed, from their Lord, that Day, they will be partitioned"},{"a":["ثُمَّ","إِنَّهُمۡ","لَصَالُواْ","ٱلۡجَحِيمِ"],"w":["Then","indeed, they","(surely) will burn","(in) the Hellfire"],"t":["thumma","innahum","laṣālū","l-jaḥīmi"],"p":[1,2,3,4],"en":"Then indeed, they will [enter and] burn in Hellfire"},{"a":["ثُمَّ","يُقَالُ","هَٰذَا","ٱلَّذِي","كُنتُم","بِهِۦ","تُكَذِّبُونَ"],"w":["Then","it will be said","This","(is) what","you used to","[of it]","deny"],"t":["thumma","yuqālu","hādhā","alladhī","kuntum","bihi","tukadhibūna"],"p":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7],"en":"Then it will be said [to them], \"This is what you used to deny"},{"a":["كَلَّآ","إِنَّ","كِتَٰبَ","ٱلۡأَبۡرَارِ","لَفِي","عِلِّيِّينَ"],"w":["Nay","Indeed","(the) record","(of) the righteous","(will be) surely in","Illiyin"],"t":["kallā","inna","kitāba","l-abrāri","lafī","ʿilliyyīna"],"p":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"en":"No! Indeed, the record of the righteous is in 'illiyyun"},{"a":["وَمَآ","أَدۡرَىٰكَ","مَا","عِلِّيُّونَ"],"w":["And what","can make you know","what","(is) Illiyun"],"t":["wamā","adrāka","mā","ʿilliyyūna"],"p":[1,2,3,4],"en":"And what can make you know what is 'illiyyun"},{"a":["كِتَٰبࣱ","مَّرۡقُومࣱ"],"w":["A book","written"],"t":["kitābun","marqūmun"],"p":[1,2],"en":"It is [their destination recorded in] a register inscribed"},{"a":["يَشۡهَدُهُ","ٱلۡمُقَرَّبُونَ"],"w":["Witness it","those brought near"],"t":["yashhaduhu","l-muqarabūna"],"p":[1,2],"en":"Which is witnessed by those brought near [to Allah]"},{"a":["إِنَّ","ٱلۡأَبۡرَارَ","لَفِي","نَعِيمٍ"],"w":["Indeed","the righteous","(will be) surely in","bliss"],"t":["inna","l-abrāra","lafī","naʿīmin"],"p":[1,2,3,4],"en":"Indeed, the righteous will be in pleasure"},{"a":["عَلَى","ٱلۡأَرَآئِكِ","يَنظُرُونَ"],"w":["On","thrones","observing"],"t":["ʿalā","l-arāiki","yanẓurūna"],"p":[1,2,3],"en":"On adorned couches, observing"},{"a":["تَعۡرِفُ","فِي","وُجُوهِهِمۡ","نَضۡرَةَ","ٱلنَّعِيمِ"],"w":["You will recognize","in","their faces","(the) radiance","(of) bliss"],"t":["taʿrifu","fī","wujūhihim","naḍrata","l-naʿīmi"],"p":[1,2,3,4,5],"en":"You will recognize in their faces the radiance of pleasure"},{"a":["يُسۡقَوۡنَ","مِن","رَّحِيقࣲ","مَّخۡتُومٍ"],"w":["They will be given to drink","of","a pure wine","sealed"],"t":["yus'qawna","min","raḥīqin","makhtūmin"],"p":[1,2,3,4],"en":"They will be given to drink [pure] wine [which was] sealed"},{"a":["خِتَٰمُهُۥ","مِسۡكࣱۚ","وَفِي","ذَٰلِكَ","فَلۡيَتَنَافَسِ","ٱلۡمُتَنَٰفِسُونَ"],"w":["Its seal","(will be of) musk","And for","that","let aspire","the aspirers"],"t":["khitāmuhu","mis'kun","wafī","dhālika","falyatanāfasi","l-mutanāfisūna"],"p":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"en":"The last of it is musk. So for this let the competitors compete"},{"a":["وَمِزَاجُهُۥ","مِن","تَسۡنِيمٍ"],"w":["And its mixture","(is) of","Tasneem"],"t":["wamizājuhu","min","tasnīmin"],"p":[1,2,3],"en":"And its mixture is of Tasneem"},{"a":["عَيۡنࣰا","يَشۡرَبُ","بِهَا","ٱلۡمُقَرَّبُونَ"],"w":["A spring","will drink","from it","those brought near"],"t":["ʿaynan","yashrabu","bihā","l-muqarabūna"],"p":[1,2,3,4],"en":"A spring from which those near [to Allah] drink"},{"a":["إِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","أَجۡرَمُواْ","كَانُواْ","مِنَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُواْ","يَضۡحَكُونَ"],"w":["Indeed","those who","committed crimes","used to","at","those who","believed","laugh"],"t":["inna","alladhīna","ajramū","kānū","mina","alladhīna","āmanū","yaḍḥakūna"],"p":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8],"en":"Indeed, those who committed crimes used to laugh at those who believed"},{"a":["وَإِذَا","مَرُّواْ","بِهِمۡ","يَتَغَامَزُونَ"],"w":["And when","they passed","by them","they winked at one another"],"t":["wa-idhā","marrū","bihim","yataghāmazūna"],"p":[1,2,3,4],"en":"And when they passed by them, they would exchange derisive glances"},{"a":["وَإِذَا","ٱنقَلَبُوٓاْ","إِلَىٰٓ","أَهۡلِهِمُ","ٱنقَلَبُواْ","فَكِهِينَ"],"w":["And when","they returned","to","their people","they would return","jesting"],"t":["wa-idhā","inqalabū","ilā","ahlihimu","inqalabū","fakihīna"],"p":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"en":"And when they returned to their people, they would return jesting"},{"a":["وَإِذَا","رَأَوۡهُمۡ","قَالُوٓاْ","إِنَّ","هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ","لَضَآلُّونَ"],"w":["And when","they saw them","they said","Indeed","these","surely have gone astray"],"t":["wa-idhā","ra-awhum","qālū","inna","hāulāi","laḍāllūna"],"p":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"en":"And when they saw them, they would say, \"Indeed, those are truly lost"},{"a":["وَمَآ","أُرۡسِلُواْ","عَلَيۡهِمۡ","حَٰفِظِينَ"],"w":["But not","they had been sent","over them","(as) guardians"],"t":["wamā","ur'silū","ʿalayhim","ḥāfiẓīna"],"p":[1,2,3,4],"en":"But they had not been sent as guardians over them"},{"a":["فَٱلۡيَوۡمَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُواْ","مِنَ","ٱلۡكُفَّارِ","يَضۡحَكُونَ"],"w":["So today","those who","believed ","at","the disbelievers","they will laugh"],"t":["fal-yawma","alladhīna","āmanū","mina","l-kufāri","yaḍḥakūna"],"p":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"en":"So Today those who believed are laughing at the disbelievers"},{"a":["عَلَى","ٱلۡأَرَآئِكِ","يَنظُرُونَ"],"w":["On","the thrones","observing"],"t":["ʿalā","l-arāiki","yanẓurūna"],"p":[1,2,3],"en":"On adorned couches, observing"},{"a":["هَلۡ","ثُوِّبَ","ٱلۡكُفَّارُ","مَا","كَانُواْ","يَفۡعَلُونَ"],"w":["Have (not)","been rewarded","the disbelievers","(for) what","they used to","do"],"t":["hal","thuwwiba","l-kufāru","mā","kānū","yafʿalūna"],"p":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"en":"Have the disbelievers [not] been rewarded [this Day] for what they used to do"}]}